# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Project large artifacts — NEVER commit. Added 2026-05-29 after a stray
# `git add .` staged the whole dataset. All of these are big and/or local-only
# (regenerated, mounted at deploy time, or downloaded), so they stay out of git.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# In-tree virtualenv. NOTE: the existing `LAW/` rule is case-sensitive and does
# NOT match the real venv dir `LaW/` — this line closes that ~5.8GB gap.
LaW/

# Raw + cleaned legal datasets (hundreds of MB of .doc / .pdf / .txt)
OriginalData/
final_total_dataset/
DataSet/
Data_Set/
data.legacy/
Rag/
Grad/

# Prebuilt retrieval index + runtime state (mounted at deploy time, never versioned)
*.pkl
*.faiss
faiss_index/
**/data/sessions/
**/data/inbox/
answer_cache.json
.ingested_files.json

# Large binaries / media / scratch
*.zip
*.crdownload
*.mp4
*.jpeg
out*.txt

# Jupyter notebooks — legacy experiment exports (large). Force-add if you truly
# need one:  git add -f path/to/notebook.ipynb
*.ipynb



